		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Ephemeral green glow that blights and drains a region.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 29, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +5 (3d6 + perish), <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> -4, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +2, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Impervious</strong>. Immune to damage from acid, cold, fire, or non-magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Incorporeal</strong>. In place of attacks, become corporeal or incorporeal.</p><p></p><p><strong>Lassitude</strong>. All creatures within far, WIS 12+ or lulled into apathy. On success, immune for 24 hours.</p><p></p><p><strong>Perish</strong>. Creatures reduced to 0 HP are dissolved and die.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
